## 2. Reverse Linked List – LeetCode #206

**Difficulty:** Easy

**Concept:** Reverse the direction of links using three pointers: `prev`, `current`, and `next`.

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
        ListNode prev = null;
        ListNode current = head;

        while (current != null) {
            ListNode next = current.next;

            current.next = prev;
            prev = current;
            current = next;
        }

        return prev;
    }
}
```

**Example:**
- Input: `1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5`
- Output: `5 → 4 → 3 → 2 → 1`

[LeetCode Problem](https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-linked-list/)

