## 5. Linked List Cycle – LeetCode #141

**Difficulty:** Easy

**Concept:** Use Floyd's Cycle Detection Algorithm.

If slow and fast pointers meet, a cycle exists in the linked list.

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public boolean hasCycle(ListNode head) {
        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {
            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;

            if (slow == fast) {
                return true;
            }
        }

        return false;
    }
}
```

[LeetCode Problem](https://leetcode.com/problems/linked-list-cycle/)

